  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "工程識圖",
    "sub_ename": "READING OF ENGINEERING DRAWINGS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培養學生閱讀、辨識各式工程圖，提升其施工管理能力。學生將學習工程圖的解讀技巧、標準符號、尺度、圖面規範等相關知識，並透過實際案例演練加強應用能力。透過本課程的學習，學生將培養出準確解讀工程圖的能力，提升施工管理效率，以及具備良好的溝通協調能力和問題解決技巧。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to train students to read and identify all kinds of engineering drawings and improve their ability of construction management. Students will learn the skills of interpreting engineering drawings, standard symbols, scales, drawing specifications, and other related knowledge, and strengthen their application ability through practical case exercises. Through the study of this course, students will develop the ability to accurately interpret engineering drawings, improve construction management efficiency, and have good communication and coordination skills and problem solving skills.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
